# Database Migrations (Alembic)

This directory contains database schema migration scripts for SeniorCare.

To autogenerate a new migration from SQLAlchemy models:
```bash
alembic revision --autogenerate -m "create initial 37 tables"
```

To apply migrations to the target database:
```bash
alembic upgrade head
```

To rollback the last migration:
```bash
alembic downgrade -1
```

